#: ../../../index.md:7
msgid "Ubuntu Desktop documentation"
msgstr "Ubuntu Desktop 文件"

#: ../../../index.md:9
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Desktop is an open-source operating system that powers millions of "
"PCs and laptops around the world. It supports daily user needs, as well as "
"professional content creation, software development and AI/ML use cases."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Desktop 是一款開源作業系統，為全球數百萬台 PC 和筆記型電腦提供運作環"
"境。它滿足了使用者的日常需求，也支援專業內容創作、軟體開發及 AI／ML 使用案"
"例。"

