#: ../../../index.md:54
msgid "Project and community"
msgstr "專案與社群"

#: ../../../index.md:56
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Desktop is one of the main versions of the Ubuntu operating system, "
"alongside [Ubuntu Server](https://ubuntu.com/server), [Ubuntu on WSL]"
"(https://ubuntu.com/wsl) and [Ubuntu Core](https://ubuntu.com/core)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Desktop 是 Ubuntu 作業系統的主要版本之一，其他版本還包括 [Ubuntu "
"Server](https://ubuntu.com/server)、[Ubuntu on WSL](https://ubuntu.com/wsl) "
"及 [Ubuntu Core](https://ubuntu.com/core)。"

#: ../../../index.md:58
msgid ""
"As an open source project, Ubuntu Desktop warmly welcomes community "
"projects, contributions, suggestions, fixes and constructive feedback."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Desktop 是一個開源專案，熱烈歡迎社群專案、貢獻、建議、修正及具建設性的"
"反饋。"

